       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INTERESTC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PRINCIPAL    PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 150000.00.
       01  WS-RATE         PIC 9(2)V99 VALUE 7.50.
       01  WS-YEARS        PIC 9(2)    VALUE 3.
       01  WS-INTEREST     PIC 9(7)V99.
       01  WS-AMOUNT       PIC 9(8)V99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE WS-INTEREST = (WS-PRINCIPAL * WS-RATE * WS-YEARS) / 100
           COMPUTE WS-AMOUNT = WS-PRINCIPAL + WS-INTEREST
           DISPLAY "22 - SIMPLE INTEREST CALCULATOR"
           DISPLAY "INTEREST: " WS-INTEREST
           DISPLAY "AMOUNT  : " WS-AMOUNT
           STOP RUN.